| info = 
* Nidus expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''25''' [[energy]] to eject an infested larva at high speed toward the targeted location over <u>'''unrestricted'''</u> range. Upon impact, the larva rapidly matures into a floating mass of infested tentacles that sprouts tendrils to grab <u>'''all'''</u> enemies within [[Line of Sight]] and a radius of {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''8 / 9 / 10 / 12''' meters, forcefully {{D|Ragdoll|Ragdolling}} and pulling them into the mass, becoming unable to move or attack while grotesquely meshing together within the writhing whirlpool of flesh. Larva will wither away when it has no enemies to grip, is cast when no enemies are in range, or after {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''4 / 5 / 6 / 7''' seconds have elapsed, dropping enemies to the ground upon expiration.
* Each enemy killed from any source while being held by Larva has a {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''50%'''<ref>https://forums.warframe.com/topic/1279280-kill-stealing-and-the-mechanics-that-suffer-from-it/page/3/?tab=comments#comment-12280351</ref> chance to generate <u>'''1/5th'''</u> of a [[Nidus/Abilities/Passive|Mutation]] stack, capped at a <u>'''100%'''</u> chance at '''200%''' {{Stat|Ability Strength}}.
* Enemies gripped by tendrils will float helplessly and rotate around the Larva, similar to the Vortex portion of {{A|Bastille}} and {{A|Sandstorm}}. Dealing damage or killing enemies in this mass can cause other affected enemies to bounce outward, swing wildly in an orbit, then be pulled back in.
* If enemies cannot be ragdolled by Larva after being attached to tendrils, they will be released after <u>'''3'''</u> seconds.
* Has a cast time of <u>'''0.6'''</u> seconds.
* Can be recast, destroying the previous instance of Larva.
* Larva is a [[One-Handed Action]] that allows movement and doesn't interrupt reload, but restricts other actions.
* Enemies grabbed by Larva are alerted to the player's presence.
* Enemies latched onto by its tendrils visually appear to be covered in infestation, while robotic targets appear encrusted in rust.
| interactions =
* Larva can be used to gather enemies with {{A|Ravenous|Ravenous's}} {{E|Maggot|Maggots}} latched on them to inflict their detonation damage to all enemies and increase Nidus's [[File:MutationGauge.png|25px|link=Mutation]] [[Nidus/Abilities/Passive|Mutation Stacks]] .
* {{E|Maggot|Maggots}} seem to prioritize enemies that are trapped in Larva.
* Can be used to gain a large amount of mutation and {{Stat|Energy}} by maximizing the numbers of enemies affected by {{A|Virulence}}.
* Larva will attach to enemies affected by {{A|Bastille}}; however, it will not pull them.
| helminth =
*Subsuming Nidus to the [[Helminth]] will offer Larva and its augments to be used by other Warframes.
**However, Subsumed Larva's range is reduced to {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''5.33 / 6 / 6.67 / 8''' meters.
**When Larva is injected onto a [[Prime]] Warframe, it will gain the appearance of {{WF|Nidus Prime}}'s Larva.
